{
  "uid": "network-topology",
  "title": "Network Topology & Ports",
  "tags": ["lan", "network", "ports", "topology", "blackbox"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "description": "LAN topology, Crux open ports, Astracap WAN forwards, and live up/down from ace blackbox probes. See docs/crux-ports.md for the inventory table.",
  "links": [
    { "title": "Crux Uptime", "type": "dashboard", "url": "/d/crux-uptime" },
    { "title": "Ace Uptime", "type": "dashboard", "url": "/d/ace-uptime" },
    { "title": "LAN Status", "type": "dashboard", "url": "/d/lan-status" }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Topology",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Network diagram",
      "description": "Logical LAN path and static WAN NAT (live inventory Jul 2026)",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 14, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "```\nInternet / ISP  (73.26.67.25 → modem 10.0.0.x)\n        |\n   Astracap .1  Gi0/0 WAN  +  Gi0/2 LAN\n   WAN NAT: TCP 80/443 → ace .5 only\n   (no static NAT to crux/nova today)\n        |\n  Astraquasar .3  (L2 switch)\n     |----------+----------+----------|\n   ace .5     crux .6    nova .7    clients\n  Caddy/DNS   Wings      Wings      DHCP .21+\n  Grafana     SFTP:2022  :443\n  Panel       SSH:22\n```\n\n**Crux firewall (Nix):** TCP **22**, **443**, **2022** public on LAN; **9090**/**9115** ace-only.\n\n**Not probed from ace:** MariaDB `:3306` (localhost), Alloy `:12345` (localhost), node_exporter `:9100` (firewalled), dynamic Docker game ports."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Hosts Up (HTTPS/SSH)",
      "description": "LAN host TCP probes from ace",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 5, "x": 14, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "displayName": "${__field.labels.up}/${__field.labels.total}",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.01 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 100 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-tcp-lan-hosts|blackbox-tcp-crux\",service=~\"wings|caddy|ssh\",service_role=~\"https|management\"}) / count(probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-tcp-lan-hosts|blackbox-tcp-crux\",service=~\"wings|caddy|ssh\",service_role=~\"https|management\"}) * on() group_left(up, total) (count_values(\"up\", sum(probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-tcp-lan-hosts|blackbox-tcp-crux\",service=~\"wings|caddy|ssh\",service_role=~\"https|management\"})) * on() group_left(total) count_values(\"total\", count(probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-tcp-lan-hosts|blackbox-tcp-crux\",service=~\"wings|caddy|ssh\",service_role=~\"https|management\"})))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "instant": true,
          "queryType": "instant",
          "range": false,
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Crux ports down",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 5, "x": 19, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-http-crux|blackbox-tcp-crux\"} == 0) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "down",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
