    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Probed ports — live status",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "align": "auto" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Status" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red", "index": 1 },
                      "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green", "index": 0 }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Latency" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "s" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 3 }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Status", "desc": false }]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-http-crux|blackbox-tcp-crux|blackbox-tcp-lan-hosts\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "status"
        },
        {
          "expr": "probe_duration_seconds{job=~\"blackbox-http-crux|blackbox-tcp-crux|blackbox-tcp-lan-hosts\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "latency"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "seriesToColumns", "options": { "byField": "instance" } },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Time 1": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "__name__ 1": true,
              "job": true,
              "job 1": true,
              "module": true,
              "module 1": true,
              "probe_location": true,
              "probe_location 1": true,
              "service_tier": true,
              "service_tier 1": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #status": "Status",
              "Value #latency": "Latency",
              "instance": "Target",
              "host": "Host",
              "service": "Service",
              "service_role": "Role"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "title": "WAN port forwards (documented)",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 27 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| WAN (Astracap Gi0/0) | Inside | Purpose | Probed? |\n|----------------------|--------|---------|---------|\n| TCP **80** | `192.168.5.5:80` | HTTP → ace / Caddy | via local HTTP probes |\n| TCP **443** | `192.168.5.5:443` | HTTPS → ace | yes (ace services + grafana) |\n| *(none)* | crux `.6` | No static NAT to crux | — |\n| *(none)* | nova `.7` | No static NAT to nova | — |\n| dynamic PAT | all LAN | Outbound internet | n/a |\n\nGame / Wings allocation ports on crux are **LAN-only** unless the Pterodactyl port-forward extension adds NAT. Re-check: `ssh astracap` → `show ip nat translations`."
      }
    }
  ]
}
